  <content>(% id="guidedtour-tutorial-page" %)
This page is your own space to practice. You created it in the first task of the Getting Started tour, and the other tasks of the tour use it too. It is in the Sandbox, so you can change anything on it without affecting the rest of the wiki.

== Continue the Getting Started tour ==

Open the Guided Tours widget at the bottom right of the screen and start the next task. Each task shows you one feature of XWiki on this page. When a task asks you to insert an image, you can use the XWiki logo, which is already attached to this page.

== Text to experiment with ==

XWiki is an open source wiki platform. Pages are organized in a hierarchy, and every change to a page is kept in its history, so you can always go back to an earlier version.

Use this paragraph to try the editor: make some words **bold** or //italic//, add a [[link to the Sandbox&gt;&gt;Sandbox.WebHome]], or turn a few lines into a list.</content>
